{"id":222079475548535,"type":"artist","name":"Unsane","artist":null,"year":1988,"weight":14,"info":{"tags":["noise rock","post-hardcore","hardcore","noisecore","noise"],"country":"US","begin":"1988","kind":"Group","similar":["Cherubs","Karp","Cows","Today Is The Day","KEN mode","Killdozer","The Jesus Lizard","Distorted Pony","Hammerhead","Fudge Tunnel"],"disambiguation":"US noise rock trio","img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Unsane_2005_red.jpg?width=500","bio":"Unsane es una banda de Noise Rock originaria de Nueva York, formada en 1988 por Chris Spencer (guitarra y voces), Pete Shore (bajo) y Charlie Ondras (batería). La banda debuta en 1991 con su disco homónimo con la discográfica independiente Amphetamine Reptile Records. Al año siguiente, Ondas muere a causa de una sobredosis de heroína; fue reemplazado por Vinnie Signorelli, el baterista actual.\n\nEn 1993, la banda ficha por Atlantic y lanza \"Total Destruction\""},"works":[{"id":242600150363991,"type":"album","name":"Unsane","artist":"Unsane","year":1991,"weight":20,"yt":"61Xm7hAR-fM","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":222945056519976,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1991","rank":129,"scaruffi":8.0},{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":148,"scaruffi":8.0},{"id":75200912416283,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Pigfuck","rank":53,"scaruffi":8.0}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":60825900377583,"type":"album","name":"Total Destruction","artist":"Unsane","year":1994,"weight":14,"yt":"sSjTYdxKy2o","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":353,"scaruffi":7.5},{"id":75200912416283,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Pigfuck","rank":113,"scaruffi":7.5}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":92378199627221,"type":"album","name":"Scattered, Smothered